      "content": "The feeling that you are a drain is a symptom of depression, not a true reflection of your value. The love and care people show you don't make you a burden; they come from a deep place of connection. It is not selfish to need support during difficult times, and you are worthy of compassion just as you are. Please remember that seeking help allows you to heal, which can ultimately benefit everyone.",
