      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain feels incredibly real, but wanting to disappear is a dangerous thought pattern fueled by overwhelming distress. The emotional weight you are describing is intensely heavy, and it's crucial to separate the feeling that you are a \"problem\" from the actual truth. Instead of focusing on what you can't give them, please allow someone else to help you carry this weight right now. Reaching out immediately to a confidential support line can provide the space you need to feel less alone.",
